Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.11,0:00:03.97,Note,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.12,0:01:35.94,Note,,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.32,0:01:42.75,Note,,0,0,0,,(黑水山脉 科罗拉多州 失落溪)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.92,0:01:42.75,Note,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.52,0:04:27.70,Note,,0,0,0,,(加州帕洛 阿尔托市)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.11,0:00:03.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邪恶力量前情提要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Previously on Supernatural...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:05.44,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那晚发生的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What happened that night
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:08.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赶快带你弟弟出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take your brother outside as fast as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.57,0:00:10.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 迪恩 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now Dean! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:12.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们亲眼目睹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What they witnessed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:14.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mary! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.48,0:00:15.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sent two brothers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.53,0:00:18.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸已经踏上了捕猎之旅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad's on a hunting trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.48,0:00:21.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他好几天没回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he hasn't been home in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:22.68,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰西 失陪一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jess excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:25.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从此踏上征途 22年后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On a quest for answers. 22 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.25,0:00:26.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发过誓我再也不猎魔了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I swore I was done hunting,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.27,0:00:27.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永远不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.06,0:00:28.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一个人干不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.63,0:00:31.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你三更半夜要突然离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now you're taking off the middle of the night
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:32.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跑去跟他们共度周末吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to spend the week end with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.11,0:00:34.61,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, everything's gonna be OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.66,0:00:35.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:39.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为妈妈希望我们这样生活吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You think mom would have wanted this for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.35,0:00:41.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 我们像战士一样被养大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean, we were raised like warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.22,0:00:42.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have a responsability.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.25,0:00:44.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对老爸还有他那猎魔运动吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To dad and his crusade.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.44,0:00:46.87,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算我们找到杀死妈妈的凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even if you do find the thing that killed her,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.87,0:00:49.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她也已经死了 回不来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mom's gone and she isn't coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.95,0:00:53.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别这样说她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't talk about her like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.23,0:00:55.18,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老爸走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.24,0:00:56.89,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有他的日记 他留下了一些信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've got his journal. He left me a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.92,0:00:59.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他给我们留的这些坐标 真奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's coordinates he left us. It's weird, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:00:59.88,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.99,0:01:00.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我之前说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What I said earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.02,0:01:02.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.95,0:01:04.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在不是煽情的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No chick flick moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.14,0:01:07.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.53,0:01:17.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.68,0:01:31.21,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有活要干了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.66,0:02:11.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老兄 你在作弊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dude, you're cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:13.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 是你太烂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, you just suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.84,0:02:21.71,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好 海莉 今天是第六天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, Hailey. Day six.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.71,0:02:22.88,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们还待在黑水山脉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're still out near Black Water Ridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.88,0:02:25.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们很好 也很安全 不用担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're fine, keeping safe, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.55,0:02:26.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明天再联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Talk to you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.21,0:02:38.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你去哪 我正赢得爽呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, where you going? My moment of victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:40.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上厕所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nature calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.49,0:03:23.47,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布拉德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Brad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.15,0:03:26.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加里 怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gary, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.68,0:04:47.34,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.05,0:04:53.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你总说你不喜欢玫瑰 所以我带了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You always said roses were lame, so, I brought you, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.34,0:05:09.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jess...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.82,0:05:12.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.81,0:05:18.47,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我应该保护好你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should have protected you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.98,0:05:20.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我应该告诉你真相的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should have told you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.17,0:05:39.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.96,0:05:41.28,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.17,0:05:43.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又做恶梦了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Another nightmare?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.43,0:05:51.19,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想开会车吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Want to drive for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.69,0:05:56.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这辈子从没这么问过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In your whole life, you never once asked me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.35,0:05:59.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是觉得你可能想开 不开算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just thought you might want to. Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.51,0:06:01.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.15,0:06:04.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你很担心我 我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're worried about me. I get it, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.67,0:06:07.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 但我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, but I'm perfectly okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.45,0:06:13.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 我们到哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right. Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.27,0:06:16.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在格兰姜欣附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are just outside of Grand Junction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:21.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.95,0:06:24.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我们不该那么早就离开斯坦福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe we shouldn't have left Stanford so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.45,0:06:27.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 我们在那查了好几周了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam, we dug around there for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.40,0:06:28.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却一无所获\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We came up with nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.89,0:06:30.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你想找到杀害杰西卡的凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you want to find the thing that killed Jessica...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:32.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就要先找到老爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Got to find dad first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.45,0:06:37.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老爸消失 二十年后这东西又再次出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad disappearing, and this thing showing up again after 20 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.94,0:06:39.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不仅仅是巧合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's no coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.23,0:06:41.47,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老爸肯定知道怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad will have answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.47,0:06:43.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他知道该怎么办 - 真是奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- He'll know what to do. - It's weird, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.96,0:06:47.39,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他留给我们的这些坐标 这个黑水山脉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These coordinates he left us, this Black Water Ridge...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.59,0:06:50.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 怎么了 - 那里什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What about it? - There's nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.59,0:06:52.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有一片森林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's just woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.80,0:06:56.91,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他为什么要我们去这种鬼地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why is he sending us to the middle of nowhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.55,0:07:06.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑水山脉太偏远了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So Black Water Ridge is pretty remote.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.96,0:07:10.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它被峡谷阻隔 地形复杂 丛林密布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's cut off by these canyons here rough terrain, dense forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.33,0:07:12.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}附近都是废弃的金银矿山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Abandoned silver and gold mines all over the place...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.95,0:07:15.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老兄 快看看这熊有多大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dude, check out the size of this frigging bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.78,0:07:22.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3} 还有一群灰熊在那片区域栖息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And a dozen or more grizzlies in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.87,0:07:24.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以肯定那里不是远足的好去处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's no nature hike, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.61,0:07:28.98,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们不会碰巧要去黑水山脉吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You boys aren't planning to go out near Black Water Ridge, by any chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.61,0:07:30.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, no, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.67,0:07:32.77,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是博尔德大学环境系的学生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're environmental study majors from U.C. boulder...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:34.49,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是为了论文的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}just working on a paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.83,0:07:36.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于回收利用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Recycle, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.68,0:07:37.82,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}屁话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.01,0:07:41.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们是那个叫海莉的女孩的朋友吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're friends with that Hailey girl, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.72,0:07:43.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.78,0:07:45.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我们是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.57,0:07:47.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威尔金森护林员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ranger... Wilkinson.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.73,0:07:50.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把跟她说的话再跟你们说一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I will tell you exactly what I told her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.95,0:07:53.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她弟弟出示了露营许可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her brother filled out a backcountry permit
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.23,0:07:56.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说他一直要在黑水山脉呆到二十四号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}saying he wouldn't be back from Black Water until the 24th.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.46,0:07:59.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以他现在还不算是失踪人口 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So it's not exactly a missing persons now, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.62,0:08:01.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉那女孩不要再担心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell that girl to quit worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.13,0:08:02.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我保证他弟弟没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sure her brother's just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.85,0:08:04.18,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.97,0:08:07.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是海莉太猴急了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, that Hailey girl's quite a pistol, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.15,0:08:08.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有过之而无不及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is putting it mildly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.01,0:08:10.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们能拿那份证明的复印件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Actually, you know what would help is
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.45,0:08:13.42,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给她看看 那就更好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if I could show her a copy of that backcountry permit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.42,0:08:16.38,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样她就知道他弟弟什么时候回去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, so she could see her brother's return date.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.03,0:08:22.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是跑来泡妞的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What, are you cruising for a hookup or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.89,0:08:23.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.76,0:08:25.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们已经有了坐标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The coordinates point to Black Water Ridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.32,0:08:26.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还在等什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.30,0:08:29.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们直接去找老爸 去找这个女孩干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's just go find dad. Why even talk to this girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.91,0:08:31.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 也许去之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know, maybe we should know
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.05,0:08:34.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们应该调查好情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what we're walking into before we actually walk into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.04,0:08:35.98,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.06,0:08:39.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你什么时候变得怎么冲动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Since when are you all "Shoot first, ask questions later" Anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:40.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Since now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.97,0:08:44.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.01,0:08:49.61,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定就是海莉·科林斯吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must be Hailey Collins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.75,0:08:51.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是迪恩 这是萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm Dean, this is Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.64,0:08:52.58,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是护林员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're rangers with the park service.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.58,0:08:53.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威尔金森护林员让我们来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ranger Wilkinson sent us over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.75,0:08:54.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们想了解一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We wanted to ask you some questions
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.93,0:08:56.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你弟弟汤姆的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}about your brother Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.39,0:08:59.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我看看工作证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me see some I.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.11,0:09:04.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.15,0:09:12.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 进来吧 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Come on in. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.09,0:09:15.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是你的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.19,0:09:16.77,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.91,0:09:18.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}车不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nice car.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.94,0:09:25.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 如果汤姆归期还没到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, if Tommy's not due back for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.01,0:09:26.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道他是出事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}how do you know something's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.01,0:09:28.49,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他每天都打电话来报平安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He checks in every day by cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:31.24,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他会电邮照片 还有视频\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He e mails photos, stupid little videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.05,0:09:33.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我们已经有三天没听到他的消息了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But we haven't heard anything in over three days now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.00,0:09:35.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许他手机没信号了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, maybe he can't get cell reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.24,0:09:37.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还有个卫星电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's got a satellite phone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.32,0:09:40.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可不可能是他玩忘形 忘记打电话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Could it be he's just having fun and forgot to check in?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.74,0:09:42.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.45,0:09:45.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的父母很早就过世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our parents are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.94,0:09:47.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只剩下我和我两个弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's just my two brothers and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:49.89,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们关系很密切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We all keep pretty close tabs on each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.47,0:09:53.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我能看看他给你发的照片吗 - 可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Can I see the pictures he sent you? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.21,0:09:55.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是汤姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.62,0:10:04.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好 海莉 今天是第六天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, Hailey. Day six.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.03,0:10:04.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们还在黑水山脉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're still out near Black Water Ridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.99,0:10:06.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们很好 也很安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're fine, keeping safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.46,0:10:08.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用担心 明天再联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so don't worry, okay? Talk to you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.67,0:10:11.71,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会找到你弟弟的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'll find your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:13.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明天一早我们就去黑水山脉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're heading out to Black Water Ridge first thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.91,0:10:15.18,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那也许我会在那见到你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then maybe I'll see you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.37,0:10:18.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.42,0:10:20.34,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能再坐在这里傻等了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't sit around here anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.34,0:10:21.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我雇了个向导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so I hired a guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.77,0:10:22.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明天就出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm heading out in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.86,0:10:24.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要亲自找到汤姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I'm gonna find Tommy myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.12,0:10:26.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你的感受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.53,0:10:31.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}介意把这些拷给我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, you mind forwarding these to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.11,0:10:33.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.03,0:10:41.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑水山脉没什么人烟 主要是去露营的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, Black Water Ridge doesn't get a lot of traffic...local campers mostly...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:45.42,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但今年四月 还是有两个旅客失踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but, still, this past april, two hikers went missing out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.42,0:10:47.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 再也没有找到 - 那之前呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- They were never found. - Any before that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.82,0:10:48.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.47,0:10:51.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一九八二年 八个人都失踪在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In 1982, eight different people all vanished in the same year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.52,0:10:53.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}官方说法是有灰熊袭击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Authorities said it was a grizzly attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.72,0:10:58.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有一九五九年 和之前的一九三六年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And, again, in 1959, and again, before that, in 1936.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.02,0:11:02.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每二十三年一次 跟闹钟一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Every 23 years, just like clockwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.73,0:11:03.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.48,0:11:05.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here's the clincher.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.99,0:11:09.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我拷来的汤姆的录像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I downloaded that guy tommy's video to the laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.79,0:11:10.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.23,0:11:14.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再来一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.81,0:11:20.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是三帧 这是一秒的片段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's three frames. It's a fraction of a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.39,0:11:22.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管那东西是什么 他速度很快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever that thing is, it can move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.11,0:11:25.89,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就说那里很邪门吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I told you something weird was going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.77,0:11:29.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 还有一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. I got one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.55,0:11:30.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}五九年的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In '59,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.99,0:11:32.98,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一个野营者幸存了下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}one camper survived the supposed grizzly attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.27,0:11:36.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是个小孩 勉强从森林里爬了出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}just a kid barely crawled out of the woods alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.10,0:11:38.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有他的姓名吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is there a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.25,0:11:40.77,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 护林员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, ranger,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.77,0:11:43.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道为什么你们要问我这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know why you're asking me about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.27,0:11:46.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这事情有官方记录 我当时还是个小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's public record. I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.32,0:11:48.67,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我父母被一个 - 灰熊吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- My parents got mauled by a... - grizzly?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.87,0:11:50.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是灰熊袭击的他们吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's what attacked them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.66,0:12:00.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同年失踪的其他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The other people that went missing that year,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.10,0:12:02.69,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是灰熊袭击吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}those bear attacks, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.38,0:12:07.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那今年失踪的人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What about all the people that went missing this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.60,0:12:09.88,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是一样吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Same thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.30,0:12:13.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们能了解我们要面对什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we knew what we were dealing with,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.82,0:12:16.44,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就有可能阻止这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we might be able to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.37,0:12:20.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I seriously doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:22.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anyways,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.90,0:12:25.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不觉得这有什么区别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't see the difference it would make.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.42,0:12:29.18,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不会相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You wouldn't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.63,0:12:31.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没人相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nobody ever did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.58,0:12:35.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肖先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Shaw...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.14,0:12:40.38,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看到什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.59,0:12:46.81,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么都没看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.85,0:12:51.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它移动地太快了 根本看不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It moved too fast to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.90,0:12:53.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且它很会隐藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It hid too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.62,0:12:55.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听到一些声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I heard it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.70,0:12:57.68,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}咆哮声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A roar...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.43,0:13:00.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}like...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.98,0:13:03.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从没听过人或动物发出这种声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}no man or animal I ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.02,0:13:05.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它是晚上出现的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It came at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.76,0:13:08.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}闯进了你的帐篷吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Got inside your tent?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.95,0:13:11.44,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它闯进了我们的小木屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It got inside our cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.24,0:13:16.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它进来的时候我在壁炉前睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was sleeping in front of the fireplace when it came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.76,0:13:19.84,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它没有打碎窗户或者门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It didn't smash a window or break the door,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.49,0:13:22.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它把锁打开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it unlocked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.29,0:13:26.69,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得熊能开锁吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you know of a bear that could do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.80,0:13:31.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听到父母的尖叫才醒过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't even wake up until I heard my parents screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.87,0:13:33.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它杀害了他们吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It killed them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.14,0:13:35.42,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把他们拖了出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dragged them off into the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:41.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从那以后我一直问自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why it left me alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:42.98,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么他没杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've been asking myself that ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.72,0:13:49.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但它却在我身上留下了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It did leave me this, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.85,0:14:03.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那森林里有很邪恶的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's something evil in those woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.46,0:14:08.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它是一种魔鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was some sort of a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.32,0:14:11.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鬼魂和魔鬼不用开锁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spirits and demons don't have to unlock doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.43,0:14:13.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们可以穿墙而过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They just go through the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.36,0:14:15.71,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以可能是别的东西 有形的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So it's probably something else...something corporeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.98,0:14:17.07,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有形吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Corporeal"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.34,0:14:18.59,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excuse me, professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.74,0:14:20.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}闭嘴 你怎么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shut up. So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.11,0:14:23.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那种爪子 还有移动的速度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The claws, the speed that it moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.88,0:14:26.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有可能是幻兽人 或者黑狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It could be a skinwalker, maybe a black dog
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.18,0:14:27.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever we're talking about,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.26,0:14:30.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它一定是一种生物 是有形的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we're talking about a creature, and it's corporeal,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.95,0:14:32.27,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这意味着 我们可以杀掉它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which means we can kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.22,0:14:52.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不能让海莉去那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We cannot let that Hailey girl go out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.52,0:14:54.07,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗 那我们怎么跟她解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh yeah, what are we gonna tell her
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:56.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为那里有怪兽出没吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she can't go into the woods because of a big, scary monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.29,0:14:57.44,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.03,0:15:00.38,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的弟弟失踪了 萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her brother's missing, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.58,0:15:02.28,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她不会袖手旁观的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's not just gonna sit this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.58,0:15:03.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我们跟她一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, we go with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.48,0:15:04.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们一边保护她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we protect her,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:06.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一边想办法杀了那个怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and we keep our eyes peeled for our fuzzy predator friend
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.87,0:15:08.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找老爸的事情还不够烦吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So finding dad's not enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.20,0:15:12.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在还要当保姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now we got to babysit, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.19,0:15:17.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.47,0:15:19.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.54,0:15:29.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再跟你说一次 你不该带本来这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll tell you again. I don't think Ben should come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.25,0:15:31.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Roy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.38,0:15:34.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你付我那么多钱是为了保证大家的安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you're paying me good money to keep everybody safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.26,0:15:36.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得本还是呆在家安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think Ben's safest at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.95,0:15:48.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们两个能加入吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You guys got room for two more?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.79,0:15:50.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想跟我们一起吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You want to come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.54,0:15:51.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些人是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who are these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.57,0:15:54.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然 公园就只能派这两个来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apparently, this is all the park service could muster up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.91,0:15:56.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们是护林员吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're rangers?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.27,0:15:57.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.27,0:15:59.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们就穿着皮鞋和牛仔裤去野外吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you're hiking out in biker boots and jeans?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.59,0:16:03.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的 我从来不穿短裤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, sweet heart, I don't do shorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.21,0:16:07.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们觉得这很好玩吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, you think this is funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.79,0:16:08.89,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偏远地区是很危险的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's dangerous backcountry out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.89,0:16:09.98,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的弟弟可能已经受伤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her brother might be hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.99,0:16:15.54,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信我 我知道那有多危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Believe me, I know how dangerous it can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.10,0:16:18.19,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们只想帮她找到她弟弟 如此而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We just want to help them find their brother. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.53,0:17:21.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伊 你说你有点打猎的经验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Roy, you said you did a little hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.13,0:17:24.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 不仅是有点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, more than a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.03,0:17:27.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你都打些什么动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What kind of furry critters do you hunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.89,0:17:29.71,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主要是雄鹿 有时候是熊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mostly buck. Sometimes bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.59,0:17:35.42,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些动物就没复过仇吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me, uh, Bambi or Yogi ever hunt you back?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.43,0:17:40.61,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你干什么 罗伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What you doing, Roy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.65,0:17:50.28,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}注意脚下 护林员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You should watch where you're stepping... ranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.18,0:17:55.44,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是捕熊夹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a bear trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.40,0:18:04.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你连口粮都没有带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You didn't pack any provisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.79,0:18:06.62,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就带了个露营包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You guys are carrying a duffel bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.73,0:18:09.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们不是护林员 你们到底是什么人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're not rangers, so who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.37,0:18:20.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和萨姆是兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam and I are brothers,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.59,0:18:22.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在找我们老爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and we're looking for our father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.40,0:18:23.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可能在这 我们不确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He might be here. We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.99,0:18:26.59,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是觉得 我们在同一条船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just figured that you and me, we're in the same boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.61,0:18:30.24,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你一开始怎么不告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why didn't you just tell me that from the start?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.67,0:18:32.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在不是告诉你了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm telling you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.74,0:18:35.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再说 我还从来没有对女人这么诚实过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Besides, it's probably the most honest I've ever been with a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.37,0:18:37.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从来没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.01,0:18:40.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}满意了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, we okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.36,0:18:46.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.69,0:18:49.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有 谁说我没带口粮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what do you mean I didn't pack provisions?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.80,0:19:06.77,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.67,0:19:08.87,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑水山脉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Black Water Ridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.93,0:19:10.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们现在坐标多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What coordinates are we at?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.75,0:19:16.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}北纬35西经111\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}35 and minus 111.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:23.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.71,0:19:24.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.13,0:19:27.88,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}连蟋蟀都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not even crickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.64,0:19:30.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要四处转转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm gonna go take a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.90,0:19:32.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不该单独行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You shouldn't go off by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.28,0:19:36.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真贴心 别担心我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's sweet. Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.81,0:19:48.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 大家都呆在一起 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, everybody stays together. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.36,0:19:59.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}海莉 来这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hailey! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.98,0:20:08.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.70,0:20:09.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来像是灰熊干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Looks like a grizzly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.08,0:20:28.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汤姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.06,0:20:31.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汤姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.62,0:20:34.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 汤姆 - 嘘…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Tommy! - Shh... Shh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.92,0:20:35.88,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.31,0:20:37.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这附近有东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Something might still be out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.82,0:20:39.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.27,0:20:49.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们被拖出了营地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The bodies were dragged from the campsite.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.88,0:20:53.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但到这里 踪迹就消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But here, the tracks just vanish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:55.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.15,0:20:59.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.87,0:21:03.42,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是幻兽人或者黑狗干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's no skinwalker or black dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.44,0:21:28.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可能还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, he could still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.71,0:21:34.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.33,0:21:58.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感觉声音是从这附近传来的 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seemed like it was coming from around here, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.14,0:22:06.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大家都回去营地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everybody back to camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.34,0:22:14.91,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的背包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our packs!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.55,0:22:18.59,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的GPS和卫星手机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So much for my GPS and my satellite phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.70,0:22:20.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.15,0:22:21.27,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它很聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.34,0:22:22.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它把我们与外界的联系切断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It wants to cut us off
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.90,0:22:23.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就没法求救了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so we can't call for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.00,0:22:25.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是指 有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You mean someone...some
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.46,0:22:28.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有个疯子把我们的东西都偷了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}nut job out there just stole all our gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.20,0:22:31.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要单独和你谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need to speak with you... in private.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.43,0:22:42.98,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 让我看看老爸的日记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, let me see dad's journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.81,0:22:49.69,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.56,0:22:51.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Check that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.75,0:22:54.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.29,0:22:56.07,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}食人魔只出没在明苏达州森林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Windigos are in the Minnesota woods
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.07,0:22:57.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者密西根北部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or Northern Michigan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.03,0:22:58.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从来没听说他们出现在西部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've never even heard of one this far west.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.43,0:23:00.61,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好好想想 迪恩 他们的爪子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Think about it, Dean...the claws,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.10,0:23:02.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}模拟人的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the way it can mimic a human voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.56,0:23:05.54,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.20,0:23:08.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那这些都没用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, then this is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.90,0:23:15.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得把这些人带到安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We got to get these people to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.18,0:23:19.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 听着 我们要离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, listen up. It's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.25,0:23:23.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事情比想象的要复杂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Things have gotten more complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.43,0:23:25.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.06,0:23:25.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子 别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kid, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.94,0:23:27.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管是什么 我都能搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever's out there, I think I can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.68,0:23:28.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我担心的不是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not I've been worried about
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.76,0:23:30.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你朝它开枪 只会激怒它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you shoot this thing, you're just gonna make it mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.90,0:23:32.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须现在离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have to leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.08,0:23:33.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}首先 你完全是一派胡言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One, you're talking nonsense,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.36,0:23:35.54,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其次 你没有发号施令的权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}two, you're in no position to give anybody orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.54,0:23:36.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.42,0:23:38.98,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们一开始就不该让你们来这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We never should have let you come out in the first place, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.06,0:23:40.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是想保护你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm trying to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.14,0:23:41.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还保护我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You protect me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.38,0:23:42.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还是个小屁孩的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was hunting these woods
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.66,0:23:43.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就在这片森林打猎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when your mommy was still kissing you good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.94,0:23:44.39,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.48,0:23:47.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是个接近完美的猎手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a damn near perfect hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.73,0:23:49.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比你更聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's smarter than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.93,0:23:51.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它会抓住你 然后把你生吞活剥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And it's gonna hunt you down and eat you alive
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.00,0:23:54.59,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除非我们带着你这蠢货离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}unless we get your stupid sorry ass out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.36,0:23:57.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你疯了 - 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You know you're crazy, right? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.48,0:24:00.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你有捕猎过 - 冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You ever hunt. - Chill out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.16,0:24:03.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}停 停 都别吵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop! Stop it. Everybody just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.13,0:24:05.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.22,0:24:08.68,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汤姆可能还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tommy might still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.18,0:24:11.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有找到他我是不会离开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I'm not leaving here without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.21,0:24:18.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天要黑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's getting late.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.44,0:24:21.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果说这东西在白天是个好猎手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This thing is a good hunter in the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.47,0:24:24.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到了晚上就是个不可思议的好猎手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but an unbelievable hunter at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.31,0:24:27.59,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚上不可能打败它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'll never beat it...not in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.64,0:24:31.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要找个地方保护自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We need to settle in and protect ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.97,0:24:34.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.01,0:24:49.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 再问一遍 那是 - 阿纳萨齐印记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- One more time.That's...? - Anasazi symbols.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.39,0:24:51.84,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是用来保护的符咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's for protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.84,0:24:53.44,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}食人魔无法越过这个印记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The windigo can't cross over them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.06,0:24:56.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没人喜欢无神论者 罗伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nobody likes a skeptic, Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.96,0:25:10.42,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能告诉我你脑子里想的什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You want to tell me what's going on in that freaky head of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.82,0:25:14.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 迪恩 - 别跟我说你没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Dean... - No, you're not fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.59,0:25:17.81,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你现在像个火药桶 你以前可不这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're like a powder keg, man. It's not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.78,0:25:21.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我才是火气大的那个 记得吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm supposed to be the belligerent one, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.49,0:25:27.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老爸不在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.62,0:25:31.68,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这点可以肯定 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, that much we know for sure, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.68,0:25:35.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不然他肯定会留下线索 信息之类的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He would have left us a message, a sign, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.05,0:25:37.87,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 也许你是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, you're probably right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.17,0:25:40.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说实话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To tell you the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.11,0:25:41.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老爸可能根本没来过失落溪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't think dad's ever been to Lost Creek.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.82,0:25:45.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们就把这些人带回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then let's get these people back to town,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.86,0:25:47.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后继续上路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and let's hit the road...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.37,0:25:50.61,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去找老爸 我们还呆在这干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go find dad. I mean, why are we still even here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.78,0:26:01.28,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is why...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.70,0:26:02.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这本日记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This book.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.00,0:26:06.44,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是老爸最珍贵的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is dad's single most valuable possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.44,0:26:09.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他了解的关于恶魔的一切都记在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything he knows about every evil thing is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.39,0:26:11.68,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而他把日记给了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he's passed it on to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.48,0:26:15.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得他希望我们继承他的事业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think he wants us to pick up where he left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.28,0:26:19.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拯救人们 猎杀恶魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, saving people, hunting things...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.41,0:26:20.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}家族工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.22,0:26:25.68,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这说不通啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.83,0:26:28.49,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么他连电话都不打一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why...why doesn't he just call us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.49,0:26:31.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他怎么不告诉我们他想怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why doesn't he tell us what he wants,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.30,0:26:32.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}tell us where he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.30,0:26:35.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.62,0:26:39.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the way I see it,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.53,0:26:43.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然是老爸留下的活 我们就要去干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}dad's given us a job to do, and I intend to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.11,0:26:45.44,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.17,0:26:47.07,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.21,0:26:49.82,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要找到老爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I gotta find dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.63,0:26:52.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要找到杀害杰西卡的凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I gotta find Jessica's killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.56,0:27:00.41,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我脑子里只有这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's the only thing I can think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.41,0:27:01.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay. All right. Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.60,0:27:03.82,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会找到他们的 我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we'll find them. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.15,0:27:06.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.50,0:27:08.62,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要做好准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've got to prepare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.53,0:27:11.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}搜寻工作可能需要花些时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, this search could take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.48,0:27:14.18,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的那些愤怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And all that anger,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.39,0:27:17.68,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能一直这样 这会要了你的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you can't keep it burning over the long haul. It's gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.98,0:27:20.92,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要有耐心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You got to have patience, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.45,0:27:25.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么做到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.86,0:27:28.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老爸是怎么做到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How does dad do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.49,0:27:31.07,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}首先 为了他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, for one, them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.52,0:27:35.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是指 我们家已经够惨了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, I figure our family's so screwed to hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.14,0:27:36.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我们可以帮帮别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}maybe we can help some others.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.04,0:27:39.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}度过难关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It makes things a little bit more bearable.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.44,0:27:46.49,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有个解恨的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I'll tell you what else helps...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.82,0:27:52.58,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽自所能的杀掉这些恶魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Killing as many evil sons of bitches as I possibly can.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.40,0:27:57.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.19,0:28:01.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please...!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.81,0:28:07.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.49,0:28:10.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它想把我们引出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's trying to draw us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.28,0:28:11.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}冷静 别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just stay cool. Stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.87,0:28:13.91,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呆在魔法圈里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Inside the magic circle?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.00,0:28:15.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.23,0:28:18.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.22,0:28:22.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 这可不是什么灰熊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, that's no grizzly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.69,0:28:31.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事的 我们会没事的 我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's okay. We'll be all right. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.29,0:28:36.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.75,0:28:44.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我击中它了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.97,0:28:45.98,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伊 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Roy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.53,0:28:47.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Roy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.27,0:28:49.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.89,0:28:55.77,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's over here. Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.40,0:28:59.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Roy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.96,0:29:29.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.48,0:29:32.47,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是说 这些东西 不该是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, these types of things...they aren't supposed to be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.71,0:29:34.41,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也希望如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish I could tell you different.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.62,0:29:37.67,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们怎么知道他有没有监视我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do we know it's not out there watching us?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.20,0:29:39.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.39,0:29:41.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们暂时安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But we're safe for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.39,0:29:45.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道这些事情的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do you know about this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.80,0:29:49.58,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世代相传\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It kind of runs in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.38,0:29:59.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白天我们有一半的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, we've got half a chance in the daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.71,0:30:03.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}首先 我自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I, for one...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.50,0:30:05.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很想杀掉这个怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}want to kill this evil son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.87,0:30:08.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我加入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, hell, you know I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.16,0:30:11.18,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}食人魔是印第安克里族语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Windigo is a cree indian word.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.19,0:30:12.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}意思是贪婪的怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It means, "Evil that devours."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.43,0:30:13.68,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们有上百年的历史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're hundreds of years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.74,0:30:15.04,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们以前都是人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Each one was once a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.29,0:30:20.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}印第安人 拓荒者 矿工 或是猎手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sometimes an indian or other times a frontiers manor a miner or hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.16,0:30:22.07,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人类怎么会变成这种东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How's a man turn into one of those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.07,0:30:23.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老生常谈了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, it's always the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.43,0:30:24.84,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}严冬来临时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}During some harsh winter,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.98,0:30:28.38,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有的人饿了 又没有补给 没有救援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a guy finds himself starving, cut off from supplies or help
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.62,0:30:30.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}于是为了生存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}becomes a cannibal to survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.11,0:30:32.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀掉了部落或者营地里的其他伙伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}eating other members of his tribe or camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.26,0:30:35.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像多纳小队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like the donner party.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.92,0:30:37.42,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世界上的各种文化都相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cultures all over the world believe
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.42,0:30:39.69,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吞噬人肉可以给自身带来特殊能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that eating human flesh gives a person certain abilities...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.69,0:30:42.69,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}速度 力量 永生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}speed, strength, immortality.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.78,0:30:44.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吞噬了足够多的同类后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you eat enough of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.49,0:30:46.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}长年累月 他们就会变成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}over years, you become this...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.98,0:30:48.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种半人半鬼的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}less than human thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.52,0:30:50.59,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们总是感到饥饿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're always hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.49,0:30:52.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果这都是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, if that's true,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.76,0:30:54.44,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汤姆怎么可能还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}how can Tommy still be alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.52,0:30:59.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你不会想知道的 - 说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You're not gonna like it. - Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.96,0:31:03.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特别的是 食人魔知道怎么度过严冬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More than anything, a windigo knows how to last long winters without food.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.44,0:31:06.47,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它有时会冬眠好几年 等它醒来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It hibernates for years at a time. When it's awake,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.88,0:31:10.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他会活捉一些人 把他们贮藏起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It keeps its victims alive. It stores them
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.38,0:31:12.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样就可以随时进食了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so it can feed whenever it wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.85,0:31:14.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你弟弟还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If your brother's alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.97,0:31:17.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它一定把他藏在黑暗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's keeping him somewhere dark,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.12,0:31:19.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}隐蔽 安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}hidden, and safe
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.70,0:31:21.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们照这个线索去找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And we got to track it back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.69,0:31:23.61,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到时候怎么阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then how do we stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.71,0:31:24.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.06,0:31:28.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}枪没用 刀也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}guns are useless...so are knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.15,0:31:30.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}基本上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Basically...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.21,0:31:32.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只能用火烧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we gotta torch the sucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.36,0:31:51.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.57,0:31:55.69,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.74,0:32:15.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.35,0:32:19.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在想那些爪印 太过清晰明显了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was thinking that those claw prints, so clear and distinct...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.19,0:32:23.57,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太易于追踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They were almost too easy to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.65,0:32:53.39,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你没事吧 - 他的脖子断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You okay? - His neck's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.13,0:32:56.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跑 跑 快跑 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Run, run! Go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.09,0:33:09.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 我抓住你了 我抓住你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on. I got you. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.13,0:33:20.49,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}海莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hailey!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.51,0:33:31.82,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.04,0:33:36.92,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他要活捉的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if it keeps its victims alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.92,0:33:38.62,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么会杀了罗伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}why would it kill Roy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.82,0:33:39.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说实话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.23,0:33:43.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为罗伊朝他开枪 把他惹恼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think because Roy shot at it, he pissed it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.98,0:33:52.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们朝这边走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They went this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.45,0:34:00.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这比用面包屑引路好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's better than bread crumbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.28,0:34:41.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}禁止入内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keep out, no admittance
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.77,0:35:46.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事的 没事的 没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, it's okay. It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.10,0:36:00.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.57,0:36:04.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快醒醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You. Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.91,0:36:07.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean. Hey. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.96,0:36:11.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.35,0:36:13.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}海莉 海莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hailey... Hailey.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.93,0:36:16.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快醒醒 快醒醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wake up. Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.23,0:36:18.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.54,0:36:31.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你确定没事吗 - 是的 它在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You sure you're all right? - Yeah, yeah. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.63,0:36:33.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's gone for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.34,0:36:55.21,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汤姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.73,0:36:59.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汤姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.69,0:37:06.71,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把他弄下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cut him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.85,0:37:22.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会带你回家的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're gonna get you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.54,0:37:24.67,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.77,0:37:28.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}信号枪 会有用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Flare guns. Those will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.76,0:37:44.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来某人回家吃饭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Looks like someone's home for supper.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.63,0:37:45.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可跑不过它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'll never out run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.99,0:37:53.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你跟我想法一样吗 - 我觉得是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You thinking what I'm thinking? - Yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.89,0:37:58.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 听我说 跟着萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, listen to me. Stay with Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.78,0:37:59.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他会带你们出去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's gonna get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.51,0:38:01.21,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.82,0:38:06.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吃我吧 你这个畜生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's chow time, you freaking bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.83,0:38:11.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 放马过来吧 我味道好的很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, that's right! Bring it on, baby! I taste good!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.05,0:38:21.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 快来 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, come on. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.98,0:38:31.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想来点白肉吗 畜生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, you want some white meat, bitch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.44,0:38:32.77,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在这呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.32,0:38:49.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 快带他出去 - 萨姆 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Get him out of here. - Sam, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.94,0:38:51.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快走 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.33,0:38:52.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.38,0:39:03.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.71,0:39:05.67,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.83,0:39:21.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.69,0:39:26.81,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快跑 快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on. Hurry, hurry, hurry! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.59,0:39:41.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}躲到我身后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.17,0:40:25.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不坏吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.61,0:40:36.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它在营地外面徘徊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's when it circled the campsite. I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.17,0:40:39.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那灰熊起码有八九百磅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this grizzly must have weighed 800, 900 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.75,0:40:45.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真不知道怎么感谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, really, I don't know how to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.22,0:40:51.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 别破坏了这个时刻 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Must you cheapen the moment? - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.84,0:40:55.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 要跟你弟弟一起走吗 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You riding with your brother? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.49,0:40:58.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.63,0:41:12.88,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望你早日找到你父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hope you find your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.23,0:41:17.71,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多谢了 萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.41,0:41:36.91,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我讨厌露营\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Man, I hate camping.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.03,0:41:39.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.43,0:41:44.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 我们会找到老爸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam, you know we're gonna find dad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.57,0:41:47.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.05,0:41:50.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这段时间…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But in the meantime...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.02,0:41:54.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3} 我来开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm driving.
